n and GPU\n    acceleration.\n  homepage: https://github.com/scikit-hep/pyhf\n  repository: https://github.com/scikit-hep/pyhf\n  documentation: https://pyhf.readthedocs.io/\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - matthewfeickert\n    - lukasheinrich\n    - kratsg\n    - conda-forge/scikit-hep\n",
